# SDLTest_CompareSurfaces dumps the actual and reference images next to whatever the
# current working directory is whenever a comparison fails, and CLAUDE.md documents
# running test binaries straight from the repo root. Without this, one failing GPU test
# leaves untracked BMPs at the root that a broad `git add` would happily commit.
CompareSurfaces*.bmp
